WEBVTT

00:00:13.330 --> 00:00:17.040
I bring a report! Both the Camellian
and Dayerehan armies

00:00:17.040 --> 00:00:19.950
are exhibiting menacing
behavior near the borders.

00:00:19.990 --> 00:00:23.870
"Hortensian Orthodox Church Pope"
"Alexis Vall d'Hebron"

00:00:21.040 --> 00:00:23.870
What shall we do, Your Majesty?

00:00:23.870 --> 00:00:27.580
"King of the Kingdom of Hortensia"
"Charlot de Hortensia"

00:00:25.040 --> 00:00:27.580
The pope may handle it.

00:00:31.540 --> 00:00:36.300
"Hortensian Knight Templar"
"Didier Viardot"

00:00:32.040 --> 00:00:34.040
I believe we should dispatch reinforcements

00:00:34.040 --> 00:00:36.660
from the Ecclesiastical Order.

00:00:36.660 --> 00:00:39.950
Very well. Arrangements will be forthcoming.

00:00:39.950 --> 00:00:40.790
Sir!

00:00:40.790 --> 00:00:45.770
"Hortensian Orthodox Church
Ecclesiastical Order Captain"
"Georg Dalmas"

00:00:42.080 --> 00:00:45.990
So, you think this fellow Georg is shady?

00:00:45.990 --> 00:00:48.080
That may not necessarily be true.

00:00:48.080 --> 00:00:50.990
Hey, come on, don't go
starting anything in the capital.

00:00:50.990 --> 00:00:53.410
I'm not some troublemaking kid.

00:00:53.410 --> 00:00:56.910
Besides, it's not my style to be so tedious.

00:00:56.910 --> 00:00:59.830
Given the choice, I'd rather
have myself a blast in the capital.

00:01:03.620 --> 00:01:07.490
I packed you plenty of medicine
and food and things!

00:01:07.490 --> 00:01:11.330
I hear that many monsters
are appearing around the capital.

00:01:11.330 --> 00:01:15.620
I really, really hope that you'll be careful.

00:02:48.540 --> 00:02:50.540
The Dayerehan Empire.

00:02:50.540 --> 00:02:53.990
This nation, on the eastern side
of the Iepetas Peninsula,

00:02:53.990 --> 00:03:00.290
has been plotting to invade the
Kingdom of Hortensia for over 700 years.

00:03:00.290 --> 00:03:02.330
What had prevented such an invasion

00:03:02.330 --> 00:03:05.080
was the keystone to
the defense of Hortensia's border--

00:03:05.080 --> 00:03:09.080
the dominion of Camellia. However,

00:03:09.080 --> 00:03:13.790
following Duke Rugis's uprising,
Camellia and Dayereh formed an alliance,

00:03:13.790 --> 00:03:18.240
and are currently posing a threat to Hortensia.

00:03:22.160 --> 00:03:24.620
Are you sure about this, Marius?

00:03:25.540 --> 00:03:26.910
About what?

00:03:26.910 --> 00:03:28.040
I mean, earlier,

00:03:28.040 --> 00:03:32.830
you stubbornly refused a summons
from the Orthodox Church.

00:03:32.830 --> 00:03:36.870
To be honest, heading to the capital
has me feeling depressed.

00:03:36.870 --> 00:03:38.870
But back at Petale Village,

00:03:38.870 --> 00:03:41.990
we were attacked by the Ecclesiastical
Knights without provocation.

00:03:41.990 --> 00:03:45.120
There really is something strange about that.

00:03:45.120 --> 00:03:50.660
I need to go to the capital, too.
I can't stand to just sit around and wait.

00:03:52.490 --> 00:03:54.580
H-Hey!

00:03:54.580 --> 00:03:56.200
What's all that about?

00:03:56.200 --> 00:03:58.040
What is it, Deflotte?

00:04:03.790 --> 00:04:07.660
Merchants. This is just terrible.

00:04:07.660 --> 00:04:11.540
Their cargo is still here.
This wasn't done by bandits.

00:04:12.660 --> 00:04:14.370
This was the work of monsters.

00:04:14.370 --> 00:04:16.200
Huh?

00:04:16.200 --> 00:04:18.790
Deflotte, what is it <i>moru</i> ?

00:04:21.700 --> 00:04:25.450
Sure enough. I thought I saw something move.

00:04:25.450 --> 00:04:26.870
Survivors?

00:04:32.700 --> 00:04:33.870
Children?

00:04:33.870 --> 00:04:36.080
Are you both all right?

00:04:36.080 --> 00:04:37.990
What in the world happened here?

00:04:39.240 --> 00:04:42.790
From the look of it, these two are
from the Dayereh Empire.

00:04:42.790 --> 00:04:45.580
I doubt they understand the Hortensian tongue.

00:04:45.580 --> 00:04:48.700
It's likely that they were
caught by slave traders

00:04:48.700 --> 00:04:51.040
while wandering near the border.

00:04:51.040 --> 00:04:52.290
Did you say slave?

00:04:52.290 --> 00:04:53.990
That's awful <i>moru</i> .

00:04:53.990 --> 00:04:56.990
So, what do we do about these two?

00:04:56.990 --> 00:04:58.910
Varila Village is up ahead.

00:04:58.910 --> 00:05:01.410
Let's go ask their lord to take them in.

00:05:01.410 --> 00:05:03.370
That sounds reasonable.

00:05:04.540 --> 00:05:06.450
There's nothing to worry about now.

00:05:21.370 --> 00:05:24.120
Things look pretty run down here.

00:05:24.120 --> 00:05:27.910
Varila Village should be flourishing
as a post-station town.

00:05:27.910 --> 00:05:32.290
Blame all the monsters. People can't
go traveling for the fun of it anymore.

00:05:32.290 --> 00:05:36.200
Let's just have someone
direct us to where the lord is.

00:05:36.200 --> 00:05:38.870
Oh, hold on! I've got it!

00:05:41.290 --> 00:05:46.990
Pardon me, my beautiful madam,
but we are travelers.

00:05:46.990 --> 00:05:51.330
We have stopped here to meet the lord of Varila.

00:05:51.330 --> 00:05:52.540
What is he...?

00:05:52.540 --> 00:05:54.910
He's sure going at it with gusto <i>moru</i> .

00:05:54.910 --> 00:05:59.080
I'm sorry, but right now, the lord is absent.

00:05:59.080 --> 00:06:01.910
Then why don't we have some tea together
and wait for the lord's retur--

00:06:01.910 --> 00:06:05.490
Hey! Don't get carried away!

00:06:05.490 --> 00:06:08.620
Excuse me, but when will
the lord be coming back?

00:06:08.620 --> 00:06:10.870
No, you misunderstand.

00:06:10.870 --> 00:06:12.290
Huh?

00:06:12.290 --> 00:06:15.990
Because of the monsters,
there are fewer visitors to the village,

00:06:15.990 --> 00:06:19.410
and our lives here have become more difficult.

00:06:19.410 --> 00:06:24.830
Our lord did nothing but
siphon away our taxes and food,

00:06:24.830 --> 00:06:26.490
until finally, he abandoned the village,

00:06:26.490 --> 00:06:28.790
and went to the capital.

00:06:28.790 --> 00:06:31.040
Your lord abandoned his people?

00:06:31.040 --> 00:06:33.660
There is no way that can be permitted.

00:06:33.660 --> 00:06:35.450
It's all right, though.

00:06:35.450 --> 00:06:39.490
We decided to remodel the mansion
where the lord lived,

00:06:39.490 --> 00:06:41.790
and turn it into a church.

00:06:42.910 --> 00:06:46.490
The reason why Varila has grown so poor
is because we don't have a church.

00:06:46.490 --> 00:06:50.870
That is why God has not protected our village.

00:06:50.870 --> 00:06:53.580
Once we have a church,
the monsters will go away,

00:06:53.580 --> 00:06:55.620
and life will return to our village.

00:06:55.620 --> 00:06:58.830
Wh-What are you talking about?
Doing that won't--

00:06:58.830 --> 00:07:00.660
Leave it alone, Marius.

00:07:00.660 --> 00:07:05.450
But why? They're building
a church for no reason.

00:07:05.450 --> 00:07:06.950
Yeah.

00:07:06.950 --> 00:07:11.040
But these people need hope.

00:07:11.040 --> 00:07:14.240
It wouldn't be right to do anything
to take that away from them.

00:07:19.660 --> 00:07:25.870
At last, we can rest. By the way, my lord,
what do we do with these two?

00:07:25.870 --> 00:07:29.410
With the village in the state it's in,
we can't turn them over to them.

00:07:29.410 --> 00:07:32.160
We'll take the children with us to the capital.

00:07:32.160 --> 00:07:35.660
All right. Good for you guys!

00:07:38.700 --> 00:07:40.990
They don't have to reject me <i>that</i> hard.

00:07:41.950 --> 00:07:45.700
It looks like the two of them have
taken quite a liking to Alfred.

00:07:47.620 --> 00:07:52.120
You must be bored after today's long journey.
How about a card game?

00:07:54.790 --> 00:07:58.660
Hmm? Oh, how about the four of us play?

00:07:58.660 --> 00:08:01.450
Would you like to eat with me?

00:08:01.450 --> 00:08:04.580
Oh... Not to your liking?

00:08:05.990 --> 00:08:08.160
Here, time to go to bed.

00:08:10.330 --> 00:08:12.990
We can't have all three of us sleeping in here!

00:08:15.830 --> 00:08:19.740
You two sleep in this bed. Okay?

00:08:24.790 --> 00:08:28.410
Why are you the only one that
both of them have become attached to?

00:08:28.410 --> 00:08:32.740
I don't know. Maybe because I used to
play with my sister so much long ago.

00:08:32.740 --> 00:08:34.660
Yeah, but I have a...

00:08:35.700 --> 00:08:38.740
I mean, never mind.

00:08:38.740 --> 00:08:40.490
I'm going to sleep.

00:08:40.490 --> 00:08:41.580
Sure.

00:08:47.240 --> 00:08:49.080
Those were the days.

00:08:58.790 --> 00:08:59.950
Good night.

00:09:07.200 --> 00:09:10.290
Who would have guessed things
would turn out like this?

00:09:10.290 --> 00:09:13.870
This is all on you, Saria. You said you
wanted to ride in the wagon, didn't you?

00:09:13.870 --> 00:09:15.700
I never said that.

00:09:15.700 --> 00:09:16.740
Yes you did.

00:09:16.740 --> 00:09:18.450
No I didn't.

00:09:18.450 --> 00:09:21.830
Right now, it's my turn to be right.

00:09:21.830 --> 00:09:24.040
Okay, then I said it.

00:09:24.040 --> 00:09:25.910
There, you see?

00:09:25.910 --> 00:09:31.490
It is, after all, your turn to
be right, Elva. So, what do we do?

00:09:31.490 --> 00:09:35.700
I've taken a liking to that man for some reason.

00:09:35.700 --> 00:09:38.580
Me, too. So then...

00:09:38.580 --> 00:09:40.450
Mm-hmm...

00:09:40.450 --> 00:09:42.240
We wait a little longer.

00:09:57.660 --> 00:10:00.490
All right, we've reached the capital.

00:10:00.490 --> 00:10:02.950
Good grief, finally!

00:10:02.950 --> 00:10:06.370
Qoo, I hate to ask, but stay hidden
while we're in the capital.

00:10:06.370 --> 00:10:07.910
You got it <i>moru</i> !

00:10:07.910 --> 00:10:11.120
Hey! If it isn't Maurice!

00:10:11.120 --> 00:10:12.870
Yo, Bertrand!

00:10:12.330 --> 00:10:15.300
"Hortensia Royal Order, 
Squad 4 Commander"
"Bertrand de Bosque"

00:10:12.870 --> 00:10:15.450
What are you doing back here?

00:10:15.450 --> 00:10:18.450
I'm accompanying my lord here, actually.

00:10:18.450 --> 00:10:20.990
It has been too long, Commander Bertrand.

00:10:20.990 --> 00:10:23.870
Oh, it's Fernando's boy!

00:10:23.870 --> 00:10:26.200
You sure have grown up, haven't you?!

00:10:28.830 --> 00:10:31.660
And I am glad to see that you are
as robust as ever, Commander.

00:10:31.660 --> 00:10:35.450
Huh? Are those Dayerehans?

00:10:35.450 --> 00:10:39.160
Yes. We picked them up on the road
after they were attacked by monsters.

00:10:39.160 --> 00:10:45.290
Oh, is that right? Well, we should
take them to the orphanage,

00:10:45.290 --> 00:10:47.120
but the times being what they are...

00:10:47.120 --> 00:10:51.040
Their being Dayerehans
is going to be a bit of a problem.

00:10:52.700 --> 00:10:54.040
All right!

00:10:54.040 --> 00:10:57.580
Let me give you a hand with this!

00:10:57.580 --> 00:11:00.370
The orphanage is this way! Come with me!

00:11:00.370 --> 00:11:02.740
Just a minute, please, Commander Bertrand!

00:11:02.740 --> 00:11:05.040
Huh? Okay...

00:11:05.040 --> 00:11:09.080
Marius, Deflotte, you two
go with Commander Bertrand

00:11:09.080 --> 00:11:11.620
and take the children to the orphanage.

00:11:11.620 --> 00:11:15.330
Maurice and I are both knights;
we'll go deliver our report by ourselves.

00:11:17.370 --> 00:11:18.740
All right.

00:11:20.490 --> 00:11:22.620
This is where we part ways.

00:11:22.620 --> 00:11:26.370
It'll be all right. The capital's
orphanage is a safe place.

00:11:30.740 --> 00:11:35.660
Once our errand is over, I'll buy you a drink.
The capital has the best drinks!

00:11:35.660 --> 00:11:37.490
Oh yeah!

00:11:37.490 --> 00:11:38.910
You really can't beat a good drink!

00:11:38.910 --> 00:11:40.910
Yeah, drinks!

00:11:42.830 --> 00:11:44.120
Charlot...

00:11:45.080 --> 00:11:48.870
Marius! As soon as we drop these two off...

00:11:48.870 --> 00:11:50.200
Hey, Marius...

00:11:51.410 --> 00:11:54.240
Where did those kids go?

00:11:54.240 --> 00:11:55.490
Oh, no!

00:11:58.040 --> 00:12:00.700
You were attacked by Ecclesiastical Knights?

00:12:00.700 --> 00:12:03.660
Yes. It happened when we were
investigating Petale Village

00:12:03.660 --> 00:12:06.740
under your orders, Captain Georg.

00:12:06.740 --> 00:12:08.410
I see.

00:12:08.410 --> 00:12:11.040
And you wonder if I wasn't
the one who sent them?

00:12:12.580 --> 00:12:18.580
I swear on my soul and on my blood
that I did not have you attacked.

00:12:20.240 --> 00:12:23.870
We never doubted you from the start.

00:12:23.870 --> 00:12:27.330
You have no reason
to want us eliminated, after all.

00:12:27.330 --> 00:12:29.540
That's why we came to ask you personally.

00:12:29.540 --> 00:12:31.240
Captain Georg,

00:12:31.240 --> 00:12:36.160
would you please tell us more about this?
Everything you know.

00:12:42.450 --> 00:12:47.700
The Hortensian Orthodox Church
is by no means a monolithic organization.

00:12:47.700 --> 00:12:50.040
As for Petale Village's quarantine policy,

00:12:50.040 --> 00:12:53.040
it seems that there was something
at work behind the scenes

00:12:53.040 --> 00:12:55.450
that I had no control over.

00:12:55.450 --> 00:12:59.290
Then, when you went to
try to investigate, you were attacked.

00:12:59.290 --> 00:13:01.990
Then it's something that
they don't want you finding out.

00:13:01.990 --> 00:13:03.700
Mm-hmm...

00:13:03.700 --> 00:13:06.990
There is someone within the Orthodox Church
that knows my tendencies,

00:13:06.990 --> 00:13:11.950
and is able to engage the Ecclesiastical
Order without my knowledge.

00:13:11.950 --> 00:13:15.080
If there is anyone capable of this,

00:13:15.080 --> 00:13:16.370
it would be...

00:13:21.040 --> 00:13:22.290
What was that?!

00:13:22.290 --> 00:13:25.120
Captain Georg! There are
monsters in the cathedral!

00:13:33.200 --> 00:13:36.950
You sent them to the capital of Hortensia?

00:13:36.950 --> 00:13:40.700
Don't tell me that <i>she</i> put you up to it.

00:13:40.700 --> 00:13:42.290
Perhaps.

00:13:42.290 --> 00:13:45.990
What exactly did you order them to do?

00:13:45.990 --> 00:13:49.120
Nothing special. I just told them
that that if they were bored,

00:13:49.120 --> 00:13:53.410
they might want to go and
see the sights of the capital.

00:13:53.410 --> 00:13:57.450
And while they were at it,
if they found what I am searching for,

00:13:57.450 --> 00:13:59.160
they were to bring it back to me.

00:14:00.160 --> 00:14:01.870
Marius, did you find them?

00:14:01.870 --> 00:14:03.450
No.

00:14:03.450 --> 00:14:06.830
I'm sorry. I shouldn't have
taken my eyes off of them.

00:14:09.040 --> 00:14:10.660
What is <i>that</i> ?!

00:14:12.330 --> 00:14:14.040
The cathedral!

00:14:16.990 --> 00:14:18.910
Your Holiness!

00:14:18.910 --> 00:14:20.950
What is it?

00:14:20.950 --> 00:14:22.450
Please, you must run--

00:14:24.410 --> 00:14:28.120
Hmm, so this is the cathedral.

00:14:28.120 --> 00:14:30.990
I wonder if <i>it</i> is here.

00:14:30.990 --> 00:14:32.870
Who are you...?!

00:14:32.870 --> 00:14:37.410
This one is still alive! Incredible, incredible!

00:14:38.660 --> 00:14:39.990
Please run,

00:14:39.990 --> 00:14:41.080
Your Holiness--

00:14:43.290 --> 00:14:44.330
Oh...

00:14:44.330 --> 00:14:46.450
So that's the pope.

00:14:46.450 --> 00:14:48.660
This means our task is over.

00:14:48.660 --> 00:14:50.290
We did it, Saria!

00:14:50.290 --> 00:14:52.700
Yes we did, Elva.

00:14:52.700 --> 00:14:54.200
And who are you?

00:14:54.200 --> 00:14:56.990
Hey, let's have the thing!

00:14:56.990 --> 00:14:59.740
We were told to bring it back with us.

00:14:59.740 --> 00:15:01.910
You have it, right?

00:15:01.910 --> 00:15:04.240
The "relic"?

00:15:07.200 --> 00:15:09.490
The pope is the heart of the Orthodox Church.

00:15:09.490 --> 00:15:11.290
We cannot afford to lose him!

00:15:15.580 --> 00:15:18.200
That's... the devil's power!

00:15:18.200 --> 00:15:21.120
Those were summoned using foreign magic!

00:15:21.120 --> 00:15:23.080
I don't care if it's magic or not,

00:15:23.080 --> 00:15:24.620
all we can do is fight them!

00:15:24.620 --> 00:15:26.330
You guys!

00:15:26.330 --> 00:15:27.580
Let's go!

00:15:42.410 --> 00:15:44.950
There's no end to them.

00:15:44.950 --> 00:15:48.330
Whoever is summoning
these monsters must be nearby.

00:15:48.330 --> 00:15:50.660
Probably inside the cathedral.

00:15:53.370 --> 00:15:56.450
Take this!

00:16:00.950 --> 00:16:02.990
How do you like <i>that</i> ?!

00:16:02.990 --> 00:16:06.330
Thank you for that, Commander Bertrand.

00:16:06.330 --> 00:16:08.290
Let's go rescue the pope!

00:16:08.290 --> 00:16:09.910
--Yeah!
--Right!

00:16:09.910 --> 00:16:15.080
Come on, you <i>do</i> have the relic, right?
Hurry and give it up!

00:16:16.290 --> 00:16:18.200
If you don't give it to us...

00:16:20.410 --> 00:16:22.290
Are you all right, Your Holiness?!

00:16:24.580 --> 00:16:26.700
Ah, it's those guys!

00:16:26.700 --> 00:16:29.540
Thanks for bringing us to the capital!

00:16:29.540 --> 00:16:32.200
It's been lots of fun!

00:16:32.200 --> 00:16:33.700
Oh, no...

00:16:34.620 --> 00:16:39.080
This was all... your doing...?

00:16:39.080 --> 00:16:41.240
You were the ones who summoned the monsters...

00:16:41.240 --> 00:16:42.870
...and killed these soldiers...

00:16:42.870 --> 00:16:45.620
Mm-hmm, we killed them!

00:16:45.620 --> 00:16:48.370
Why?! Why would you do this?!

00:16:49.450 --> 00:16:53.120
Because it was fun to do, obviously!

00:16:55.040 --> 00:16:57.870
Plus Rugis sent us here on an errand.

00:16:57.870 --> 00:16:58.950
Did he say Rugis?

00:16:58.950 --> 00:17:01.700
These two are Camellian assassins!

00:17:01.700 --> 00:17:05.410
We were thinking of
killing all of you at first...

00:17:05.410 --> 00:17:09.740
...but since we came to like you,
mister, we let you live.

00:17:09.740 --> 00:17:13.120
So don't get in our way <i>now</i> , will you?

00:17:13.120 --> 00:17:15.410
That's fair, right, mister?

00:17:16.660 --> 00:17:18.830
Mister?

00:17:18.830 --> 00:17:22.120
I... will stop you!

00:17:23.660 --> 00:17:28.870
Hey, you kids! We are going to nab you,
even if we have to use force!

00:17:28.870 --> 00:17:30.950
Would you be quiet?

00:17:32.660 --> 00:17:34.490
Do not interfere...

00:17:34.490 --> 00:17:35.870
...with us!

00:17:40.620 --> 00:17:44.450
Whoa, hey! If that had hit us,
there'd be nothing left of us!

00:17:44.450 --> 00:17:46.160
This time, I won't miss.

00:17:46.160 --> 00:17:48.120
We're going to make you suffer!

00:17:54.870 --> 00:17:56.370
They got wiped out?

00:17:56.370 --> 00:17:58.870
Remember this well!

00:17:58.870 --> 00:18:01.620
The vulgar powers of the devil are no match

00:18:01.620 --> 00:18:05.990
before the power of righteous teachings!

00:18:05.990 --> 00:18:08.240
So he really does have the--

00:18:10.200 --> 00:18:14.200
I won't bring any harm to you.
So you have to stop this!

00:18:18.950 --> 00:18:19.790
What was that?!

00:18:19.790 --> 00:18:21.580
What's that sound?!

00:18:21.580 --> 00:18:23.620
Yes! She came!

00:18:23.620 --> 00:18:26.200
She's coming to save us!

00:18:35.240 --> 00:18:36.950
What is that thing?!

00:18:36.950 --> 00:18:38.290
A salamandre!

00:18:38.290 --> 00:18:42.450
The mightiest creature there is
in all of Magonian lore.

00:18:46.120 --> 00:18:49.240
They're even bringing these things to life?!

00:18:50.620 --> 00:18:52.240
We are knights.

00:18:52.240 --> 00:18:54.120
We cannot back down!

00:18:56.790 --> 00:19:02.240
My, my, what an unusual visitor we have.

00:19:02.240 --> 00:19:05.370
That's... the Black Knight, Didier!

00:19:05.370 --> 00:19:08.410
Didier, please, you must protect the pope.

00:19:08.410 --> 00:19:09.580
Mm-hmm.

00:19:14.410 --> 00:19:18.330
I will slay this dragon.

00:19:28.660 --> 00:19:30.240
What is the story with this guy?!

00:19:30.240 --> 00:19:34.330
He's on a completely different level
than the rest of us.

00:19:39.540 --> 00:19:43.990
It may be a legendary creature,
but it still has a physical body.

00:19:43.990 --> 00:19:46.950
It can still be laid low.

00:19:46.950 --> 00:19:50.080
Isn't that right, crimson dragon?

00:19:51.740 --> 00:19:53.080
Saria, let's go.

00:19:53.080 --> 00:19:54.080
Yeah.

00:19:55.330 --> 00:19:57.330
They're trying to get away!

00:19:58.660 --> 00:20:00.870
See you later, everybody!

00:20:00.870 --> 00:20:04.540
It's been fun! You'll have to
play with us again sometime!

00:20:04.540 --> 00:20:05.740
Oh, screw that!

00:20:05.740 --> 00:20:07.160
Hold it!

00:20:24.830 --> 00:20:27.410
Damn those kids.

00:20:27.410 --> 00:20:30.330
The next time we see them,
we'll show them no mercy!

00:20:31.410 --> 00:20:34.200
Yeah... right.

00:20:35.790 --> 00:20:37.240
Are you all right, Your Holiness?

00:20:37.240 --> 00:20:39.120
Yes.

00:20:39.120 --> 00:20:44.490
I am terribly sorry, Your Holiness.
They managed to get away.

00:20:44.490 --> 00:20:48.040
It seems that all signs of the monsters
are gone from the capital now.

00:20:48.040 --> 00:20:49.660
And King Charlot?

00:20:49.660 --> 00:20:51.700
He is safe.

00:20:51.700 --> 00:20:54.990
There is someone within the Orthodox Church
that knows my tendencies,

00:20:54.990 --> 00:20:59.950
and is able to engage the Ecclesiastical
Order without my knowledge.

00:20:59.950 --> 00:21:03.660
If there is anyone capable of this...

00:21:03.660 --> 00:21:07.660
...it would be Pope Vall d'Hebron,
and the Black Knight, Didier.

00:21:34.240 --> 00:21:38.080
Thank you, Theresia! I love you!

00:21:38.080 --> 00:21:40.160
Me too, me too!

00:21:40.160 --> 00:21:42.950
I'm glad that neither of you were hurt.

00:21:42.950 --> 00:21:47.200
But we weren't able to finish
the errand we were sent to do.

00:21:47.200 --> 00:21:51.240
It looks as though the pope
has the relic, all right.

00:21:51.240 --> 00:21:52.660
Yes.

00:21:53.830 --> 00:21:56.160
We have to go tell Rugis about this.

00:21:58.420 --> 00:22:02.080
Chapter 4

00:21:58.420 --> 00:22:02.080
Turnabout

00:21:58.420 --> 00:22:02.080
~Prelude to Turmoil~

00:23:33.450 --> 00:23:36.490
I was hoping to catch up to
my great father as quickly as I could.

00:23:36.490 --> 00:23:39.040
...and plotting to overthrow the kingdom.

00:23:39.040 --> 00:23:40.870
I should have known you'd be the one in command.

00:23:40.870 --> 00:23:44.080
You have absolutely no idea
what the reality of this nation is.

00:23:44.080 --> 00:23:47.070
Chapter 5

00:23:44.080 --> 00:23:47.070
Impact

00:23:44.080 --> 00:23:47.070
~The Protected One~

00:23:44.080 --> 00:23:47.040
As it stands, that is how
the future will unfold.
